  "_about": "THE MUSKOX (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/bigmam/muskox.py -- written whole by it): on the bison's plan, the curly cape gone and a curtain of long guard hair hanging from the back and flanks nearly to the ground all round, pale stockinged lower legs beneath, a pale saddle, a low rounded hump; the long head with a pale muzzle, the horn bosses meeting across the forehead, the horns sweeping down beside the face and hooking out and up. Coats: dark brown, black-brown, Greenland (paler); variants cow, calf.",
